  "correction": "Original unexported macro_rules is textual only, so self::concat import correctly rejected by pinned rustc. Alias positive now exports its actual definition; v1 input and observation retained. Exported alias still fails on module attributes because attribute lookup uses the module scope. Added a rejecting parent-only alias, an accepted function alias and a module-local import positive. All original sources and observations retained. The isolated no_core function additionally requires its genuine Sized family. Added those declarations to the function positive only; kept prior failure. The external-module isolated no_core unit struct adds a Copy prerequisite unrelated to attributes. The child now contains only the identical macro import used by the inline-module positive; original failed child retained.",
